<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>CHUB Fleet Maintenance Hub</title>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body { 
            font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; 
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #eef4fa 0%, #f5f7fa 100%); 
            display: flex; 
            align-items: center; 
            justify-content: center; 
            min-height: 100vh; 
            padding: 20px; 
        }
        .hub { 
            background: white; 
            padding: 40px 30px; 
            border-radius: 30px; 
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px -10px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); 
            text-align: center; 
            max-width: 420px; 
            width: 100%; 
        }
        .hub h1 { 
            color: #0b3b5c; 
            margin-bottom: 8px; 
            font-size: 1.8rem; 
            font-weight: 800;
        }
        .hub p {
            color: #5b7b96;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }
        .btn { 
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            padding: 18px; 
            margin-bottom: 16px; 
            border-radius: 40px; 
            text-decoration: none; 
            font-weight: 700; 
            font-size: 1.1rem; 
            transition: 0.2s; 
            color: white; 
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); }
        .btn-gen { background: #1e4a6d; } .btn-gen:hover { background: #0f3852; }
        .btn-ac { background: #2a6b96; } .btn-ac:hover { background: #1e4a6d; }
        .btn-ref { background: #b33a3a; } .btn-ref:hover { background: #8f2929; }
        .footer { margin-top: 30px; font-size: 0.75rem; color: #9cb9d0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="hub">
        <h1>🛠️ CHUB Fleet Hub</h1>
        <p>Select a system to perform Preventive Maintenance</p>
        
        <a href="https://khillaly.github.io/Generator/" class="btn btn-gen">⚡ Generator Maintenance</a>
        <a href="https://khillaly.github.io/AirConditioner/" class="btn btn-ac">❄️ Air Conditioner Maintenance</a>
        <a href="https://khillaly.github.io/Refrigerators-freezers/" class="btn btn-ref">🧊 Refrigerator Maintenance</a>
        
        <div class="footer">© 2026 Hillaly KUBWIMANA — All rights reserved</div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
